> [K]iehl's Hydro-Plumping Re-Texturizing Serum Concentrate - 1.7 oz.
It takes more than chugging a glass of water to bring life back to dehydrated skin. Fortunately, this concentrated serum was created specifically to revive the driest of skin, reversing age-related[ dehydration] that causes fine lines and rough texture. A potent blend of plant-based glycerin and Japanese shiso leaf extract plumps skin and softens fine lines so skin looks healthy, hydrated, and restored.
Great texture! Went on[ and] soaked in like gel-water and kept my face hydrated and smooth all day. Loved[ it], will definitely purchase.
